@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
scale 1 as 60 pixels
hide time-axis

concise "벽시계 시각" as T
concise "계획 구간" as P
concise "Range .active" as A
concise "안전 출력" as S

@0
T is "07:58"
P is "시작 전"
A is "비활성"
S is "OFF"

@2
T is "08:00"
P is "range(10min)"

@6
T is "08:04"
A is "활성"
S is "ON"

@8
T is "08:06"
S is "차단됨"

@10
T is "08:08"
S is "ON"

@12
T is "08:10"
P is "종료"
A is "비활성"
S is "OFF"

@14
T is "08:12"

P@2 <-> @12 : 계획 [08:00, 08:10)
A@6 <-> @12 : 08:04 늦은 admission: 6분 남음
S@8 <-> @10 : 안전 차단, 끝에 더하지 않음
@enduml
